---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
import { withBase } from '@/data/register'
---
<SiteLayout title="Preview confirmation" noindex offer={false}><div class="shell page-space"><section class="confirmation" data-order-filled hidden><span class="confirmation-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p class="eyebrow">03 / Confirmation · Sandbox only</p><h1>Thank you for<br /><em>taking a closer look.</em></h1><p>You’ve reached the end of the sandbox purchase. No payment was taken, no email was sent, and no real order was created.</p><div class="receipt-line"><span>The Platonic Ideal Dossier</span><strong>$0 charged</strong></div><div class="fulfillment-panel"><p class="eyebrow">Sandbox fulfillment</p><h2>Here is the test handoff.</h2><p>This file is a test artifact so the complete checkout-to-fulfillment path can be exercised locally. It is not a paid entitlement or the final dossier.</p><a class="button secondary" data-analytics-event="preview_fulfillment" data-analytics-mode="preview" href={withBase('dossier/sandbox-fulfillment.txt')} download>Download sandbox file →</a></div><p>The production version still needs an approved payment provider, receipt, delivery email, refund policy, and final paid content before sales open.</p><div class="action-row"><a class="button" href={withBase('dossier/#sample')}>Read the public sample →</a><a class="inline-link" href={withBase('account/orders/')}>View preview history</a></div></section><div class="empty-state" data-order-empty><h1>No sandbox order yet.</h1><p>Explore the dossier to start the purchase preview.</p><a class="button" data-analytics-event="dossier_cta_click" href={withBase('dossier/')}>Get the dossier · $24 →</a></div></div></SiteLayout>
